# Security

**Full reference:** [SECURITY.md](../../SECURITY.md)

## Non-negotiables

- No secrets/tokens/production passwords in source; `pnpm secret:scan` before push.
- Studio APIs: `requireStudioApiAuth` or equivalent guards.
- Portal: never expose `dm_only` to unauthenticated users.
- Filter visibility in repository/service layer — not UI-only.
- Cloud AI: no campaign/brain/life context; RTX stays on LAN.
- Do not weaken CORS, CSP, or security headers without explicit review.
- No sensitive data in logs; validate uploads via `packages/assets`.

## Auth imports

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) § Common recurring failures (auth import table).

## Tests

Security-sensitive changes must pass `pnpm test:security`.
